&lt;h2&gt;About Brightwater Health&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brightwater Health builds the scheduling and records platform behind 300 community clinics. We are a small, remote-first engineering team that ships every day and keeps on-call quiet.&lt;/p&gt;
